        "zh": "### 三個人的AI工作日常\n\n同一間公司，三個不同部門的人，用著不同的Claude工具，過著各自的工作日常。\n\n#### 工程師阿凱：深夜的程式夥伴\n\n凌晨一點，阿凱還在趕專案。\n\n他打開終端機，輸入幾個字，Claude Code就開始分析整個程式碼庫。「這個bug藏在哪裡？」他問。幾秒後，螢幕上出現了答案——不只找到問題，還附上了修復建議和重構方案。\n\n阿凱記得剛開始用Claude Code的時候，還半信半疑。「AI真的懂我的程式碼？」但當它正確理解了專案架構，甚至能預測他下一步要做什麼的時候，他知道這不只是個聊天機器人。\n\n「幫我寫這個功能的單元測試。」他說。Claude Code不只寫了測試，還自動執行，回報結果。阿凱看著綠色的通過標記，終於可以安心commit了。\n\n#### 行銷主管Linda：品牌的守護者\n\nLinda的工作是確保所有對外溝通都符合品牌調性。\n\n她花了一個下午，把公司的品牌手冊、過去的成功案例、常見問答全部上傳到Skills。現在，不管是新進同事還是外包廠商，只要問Claude，就能得到符合品牌語調的回答。\n\n「用我們的品牌風格，寫一則新產品發布貼文。」實習生在Claude對話框中輸入。幾秒後，一篇完美符合公司調性的文案出現了——專業但不生硬，親切但不隨便。\n\nLinda看著這一切，想起以前每一篇文案都要親自審核的日子。現在，Skills就像一個永遠在線的品牌顧問，24小時守護著她建立的品牌標準。\n\n#### 行政助理小美：告別重複性工作\n\n小美最討厭的就是月底的報表整理。\n\n幾十個Excel檔案要彙整、格式要統一、數字要核對——以前總要花一整天。但自從裝了Cowork，一切都不一樣了。\n\n她設定好流程：每月25號自動從指定資料夾抓取檔案、合併報表、套用格式、產生摘要。現在她只需要最後看一眼確認，工作量從一天變成十分鐘。\n\n「它就像一個不會抱怨的助理，」小美笑著跟同事說，「而且從不請假。」\n\n#### 三種工具，一個目標\n\n阿凱用Claude Code寫更好的程式，Linda用Skills守護品牌一致性，小美用Cowork告別繁瑣的重複工作。\n\n工具不同，但目標相同——讓AI處理機械性的工作，讓人專注在真正需要創意和判斷的事情上。\n\n#### 🤖 使用小提醒\n\n- 各工具功能持續更新，請以官方公告為準\n- 建議從免費方案開始體驗核心功能\n- 工作流程整合需評估團隊實際需求\n- 善用官方文件與社群資源加速上手\n\n#### ● 找到適合你的Claude工具",
        "en": "### Three People, Three AI Tools, One Workday\n\nSame company, three different departments, three different Claude tools, three unique work routines.\n\n#### Kai the Engineer: Late-Night Coding Partner\n\nIt's 1 AM. Kai is still pushing to meet his deadline.\n\nHe opens the terminal, types a few words, and Claude Code begins analyzing the entire codebase. 'Where's this bug hiding?' he asks. Seconds later, the answer appears—not just the problem, but fix recommendations and refactoring suggestions.\n\n'Write unit tests for this function,' he says. Claude Code not only writes the tests but executes them automatically. Kai sees the green checkmarks and finally commits with confidence.\n\n#### Linda the Marketing Director: Brand Guardian\n\nLinda's job is ensuring all communications match brand voice.\n\nShe spent an afternoon uploading brand guidelines, successful campaigns, and FAQs to Skills. Now, whether it's new hires or external agencies, anyone can ask Claude and get on-brand responses.\n\nSkills is like an always-online brand consultant, protecting the standards she built 24/7.\n\n#### Mei the Admin Assistant: Goodbye Repetitive Work\n\nMei's least favorite task? Month-end report compilation.\n\nDozens of Excel files to merge, formats to standardize, numbers to verify—it used to take all day. But since installing Cowork, everything changed.\n\nShe set up a workflow: automatically grab files on the 25th, merge reports, apply formatting, generate summaries. Now she just reviews the final output. A full day's work became ten minutes.\n\nDifferent tools, same goal—let AI handle mechanical work so humans can focus on creativity and judgment.\n\n#### 🤖 USAGE TIPS\n\n- Features continuously updated, refer to official announcements\n- Start with free tier to experience core functions\n- Evaluate team needs before workflow integration\n- Leverage documentation and community resources\n\n#### ● Find Your Claude Tool"
